{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>But the men of the city, the men of Sodom.</b> This comes to hint that the men of Sodom — the men of the city and the tower — were utter wicked men; they are the generation of the Dispersion (ha-plagah) who said, 'Let us build for ourselves a city and a tower.' And 'the men of the city' is to be read as 'the men of Sodom.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:13:34.345560680Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}